+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+/*
+ * Copyright (C) 2015 ARM Limited
+ *
+ * Author: Will Deacon <will.deacon@arm.com>
+ * Arm SMMUv3 driver functions shared with hypervisor.
